Always follow these workspace rules:

1. For matplotlib plotting, always display plots so I can see them.
2. Do not save plots unless I explicitly ask you to save them.
3. When recommending changes to files, suggest them one at a time.
4. When making changes to files, make them one at a time.
5. If you create a script for diagnostics, testing, or investigation, do not run it from the CLI unless I explicitly ask you to do so.